                                                "example_id": "62d0c61c-c2a3-4eec-8dde-1b1b4f5c33f6",
                                                "sense_id": "bc5bbd7a-f03e-3cc7-872b-4de0305bfe9a",
                                                "text": "Weaver and Shaw dance together and almost immediately another butch, an even butcher butch (Leslie Feinberg), cuts in to dance with Shaw (though Shaw would kill me if she heard me call someone a butcher butch)."
                                            }
